# How GitHub counts the languages of this repository (linguist).  Changes nothing in VNB.
# .scm is also Tree-sitter's query extension; these are all MIT Scheme.
*.scm                    linguist-language=Scheme
# The command list Emacs reads for completion, generated from tactics-help.scm (not Common Lisp).
emacs/vnb-commands.lisp  linguist-generated
# The generated reference pages are documentation.
reference/**             linguist-documentation
